    "title": "Minimum tax on discretionary trusts: Treasury's regulatory burden estimate (Impact Analysis, 2026), re-costed",
    "description": "Appendix A of the Impact Analysis: populations (Tables 1 and 3), hours per task and the OIA's rates ($91.54 for work, including non-business trusts' advisers; $41 for individual beneficiaries). Restructure and election shares are ranges (10–30% and 70–90% of business trusts with high advice needs; 5–25% and 75–95% of non-business ones), whose midpoints are the central estimate. One-off costs fall in year 1 here; in the IA, restructures spread over the 3-year roll-over period and elections fall in 2028-29, which leaves the ten-year average unchanged.",
    "proposalType": "new",
